## 7. System Architecture

Tax Buddy is a SwiftUI iOS app with local assets, local PDF reference data, and Firebase AI integration.

```text
User
  |
  v
SwiftUI Views
  |
  +--> Welcome.swift
  |      |
  |      +--> Practice Mode
  |      +--> Real Mode
  |
  +--> StepsView.swift
         |
         +--> Step data model
         +--> Practice profile model
         +--> Guided UI cards
         +--> User input state
         +--> Conditional navigation
         +--> PDFKit text extraction
         +--> Firebase AI tax estimate request
```

### Frontend Structure

The frontend is built in SwiftUI. `Welcome.swift` handles the landing page and mode selection. `StepsView.swift` handles the full guided tax workflow.

### Backend / Cloud Services

The app uses Firebase AI / Google AI backend for tax estimation. Instead of a custom backend server, the app sends a prompt containing the taxable income and relevant PDF tax reference text.

### Data Sources

- Bundled practice profile data in Swift structs.
- Bundled form images in `Assets.xcassets`.
- Bundled `tax analysis.pdf` for tax reference.
- User-entered values in SwiftUI state.

### Third-Party Integrations

- Firebase Core for app configuration.
- Firebase AI for generative model access.
- PDFKit for reading text from the bundled PDF.

