**Symptoms:** When the user owed money, routing or refund-related cards could still appear.

**Root Cause:** Some UI components were not gated by overpayment status.

**Fix Implemented:** Conditional display logic was added so routing/account cards only appear when relevant.

**Verification:** Step 15 no-overpayment path no longer shows the routing number card.

